  "note": "Recipes for tools/speed-check.py --counts. A recipe runs in benchmark-replay, or in frond-68k with runner frond-68k; engines limits the engines it runs in. A cold boot without nand gets a blank NAND where the device has one. rom is under FROND_DEVICE_IMAGES, card (a Zodiac SD image) under ZODIAC_CARDS, session names the variable holding a session path, replay is in tests/fixtures. results are per engine; input is the start of the SHA-256 of the ROM or session they came from. Refresh with --update after a change that's meant to move them. A recipe with measure set runs and prints what it read (read: speedy takes Speedy 7.1's detail form from RAM) but has no results to compare.",
